// GetAirbnbConnection Get Airbnb connection state
//
// Returns the workspace's Airbnb host connection state in one envelope. Use this instead of inferring connection health from per-listing 401s on `GET /v1/channels/airbnb/listings` — that's noisy (every per-listing call has to fail before you know) and ambiguous (a single 5xx looks identical to a deauth).
